[[0,1914225,0,1,0,1,"2017-06-06T05:23:29","Nameless","",[],"","[MP] Imagine a world where sharks swim in the forest..","https://68.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_mcqg42itxN1qee12to4_1280.png","writingprompts"],[1,9419934,0,0,0,0,"2017-06-06T05:24:30","Nameless","",[],"<p>Yes. I <em>just</em> saw that movie for the first time. So fucking stupid haha.</p>"],[1,9422027,0,1,0,1,"2017-06-06T12:41:33","Ugwump","[e]",[],"<p>I ducked behind a tree to break the shark's rushing attack. I was so glad that I was not in the water and could see the bastards coming for me. My AR-15 wouldn't work as well full of seawater either.</p>\n<p>Shark meat for dinner again. Damn whatever mad scientist thought flying sharks was a good idea. It will take decades if not centuries until the populations of terrestrial animals gets back to normal. Just glad I can bait the things with fire.</p>\n<p>Oh well. Gonna clear the next valley tomorrow.</p>"]]
